<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets call warrant on Sino Land.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets call warrant on Sino Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said it has launched 280 million American style call warrants on shares of Sino Land Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$7.74     PREMIUM	 13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.198    GEARING	 4.34X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  30.DEC.97   PAYDATE	 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG   MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$8.60</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
